@startuml ac_uc_3_5_dashboard_health

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  DiamondBackgroundColor #BBDEFB
  DiamondBorderColor #1565C0
}

title <size:18><b>UC-3.5 — View Dashboard Health</b></size>\nActivity Diagram

|Actor|
start
:Navigate to\nSystem Health page;

|System|
if (Health data\navailable?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Display indicator:\nhealth data unavailable;
  stop
endif

:Retrieve application health\nindicators for public dashboard;
fork
  :Retrieve availability,\nerrors, HTTP status,\nlatency, failures;
fork again
  :Check YouTube Data API\nfailures affecting data product;
end fork

:Display dashboard health;
note right
  Application health:
  - Availability
  - Recent request errors
  - HTTP error status
  - Latency indicators
  - Recent failures

  YouTube API issues:
  - Auth/authz failures
  - Quota failures
  - Request failures
  - Channel lookup failures
end note

|Actor|
:Review dashboard health\nto determine if public\ndashboard is operating normally;
stop

@enduml
